	(text "This mux selects between the 5V produced by the buck if Vbus is present,\n or the 5V over USB if it is connected. It puts priority on the onboard\n 5V produced by thebuck converter (if both are present)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 232.918 105.918 0)
		(effects
